{
    "version": "1.6.2",
    "description": "vPaste 剪贴板管理器：把文本、图片、链接、颜色与文件复制历史保存为可搜索卡片，Alt+V 唤起面板、Enter 粘贴，历史仅存本地。",
    "homepage": "https://vpaste.app/",
    "license": "GPL-3.0-only",
    "architecture": {
        "64bit": {
            "url": "https://github.com/Loxonl/vPaste-desktop/releases/download/v1.6.2/vPaste_1.6.2_windows_x64_portable.zip",
            "hash": "1c12ea17999d6512d0f64cb00ad237562b86fc787a1dbf11e51a4c45b2f248f8"
        }
    },
    "bin": "vPaste.exe",
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "vPaste.exe",
            "vPaste"
        ]
    ],
    "persist": "data",
    "notes": [
        "上游 portable 包自带 portable.flag，程序把配置、历史、WebView2 缓存全部写入 exe 同级 data 目录；本清单把 data 接入 persist，升级与 scoop uninstall（不带 -p）都不会丢历史。",
        "便携版刻意不注册开机启动（设置里开关置灰），也不做自更新；升级请用 scoop update vpaste。需要开机自启可在 shell:startup 放一个指向 %SCOOP%\\apps\\vpaste\\current\\vPaste.exe 的快捷方式。",
        "默认快捷键 Alt+V 唤起面板、Alt+Shift+V 切换粘贴队列、Enter 粘贴、Shift+Enter 纯文本粘贴，可在设置中修改。",
        "需要 WebView2 运行时（Windows 11 自带，Windows 10 需安装 Evergreen Runtime）。"
    ],
    "checkver": {
        "github": "https://github.com/Loxonl/vPaste-desktop"
    },
    "autoupdate": {
        "architecture": {
            "64bit": {
                "url": "https://github.com/Loxonl/vPaste-desktop/releases/download/v$version/vPaste_$version_windows_x64_portable.zip"
            }
        },
        "hash": {
            "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Loxonl/vPaste-desktop/releases/tags/v$version",
            "jsonpath": "$.assets[?(@.name == 'vPaste_$version_windows_x64_portable.zip')].digest",
            "regex": "sha256:(.*)"
        }
    }
}
